### Sattadhar Textile — Stock module
### VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client). Run top to bottom.
### Sign in first (steps 1–2), then paste the two product ids from step 3.

@base = http://localhost:4000
@api = {{base}}/api/v1

### ─── 1. Login as ADMIN ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name adminLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "ChangeMe@123" }

###
@adminAccess = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ─── 2. Login as STAFF ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @name staffLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "kirti", "password": "Staff@123" }

###
@staffAccess = {{staffLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ─── 3. Find the seeded products — copy two ids below ──────────────────
# COT-SHIRT-WHT-003 is METER, SAR-WED-MRN-001 is PIECE,
# COT-SHIRT-SKY-003 is seeded BELOW its reorder level.
GET {{api}}/products?pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

###
@meterProductId = <PASTE_A_METER_PRODUCT_ID>
@pieceProductId = <PASTE_A_PIECE_PRODUCT_ID>

### ─── 4. Stock-in on a METER product, decimal quantity ──────────────────
POST {{api}}/stock/in
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

{ "productId": "{{meterProductId}}", "qty": 25.5, "reason": "New purchase", "supplierRef": "CH-1042", "rate": 155 }

### ─── 5. Same product, 2 decimals too many → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR ───────
POST {{api}}/stock/in
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

{ "productId": "{{meterProductId}}", "qty": 1.23456, "reason": "Too precise" }

### ─── 6. Stock-in on a PIECE product, whole number ──────────────────────
POST {{api}}/stock/in
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

{ "productId": "{{pieceProductId}}", "qty": 6, "reason": "New purchase" }

### ─── 7. Fractional piece → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR ────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/stock/in
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

{ "productId": "{{pieceProductId}}", "qty": 2.5, "reason": "Half a saree" }

### ─── 8. Adjustment down, with a reason ─────────────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/stock/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

{ "productId": "{{meterProductId}}", "qty": -3.5, "reason": "Damage — water stain on the bolt end" }

### ─── 9. Adjustment with no reason → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR ───────────────
POST {{api}}/stock/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

{ "productId": "{{meterProductId}}", "qty": -1 }

### ─── 10. Adjustment past zero → 409 CONFLICT ──────────────────────────
POST {{api}}/stock/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

{ "productId": "{{meterProductId}}", "qty": -999999, "reason": "Should be refused" }

### ─── 11. Movement ledger for that product, newest first ────────────────
# After creating a bill for this product, its SALE row appears here with the
# bill id and number attached.
GET {{api}}/stock/movements?productId={{meterProductId}}&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

### ─── 12. Same ledger as STAFF → no `rate` key on any row ───────────────
GET {{api}}/stock/movements?productId={{meterProductId}}&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 13. Low stock — visible to STAFF, no cost data ────────────────────
GET {{api}}/stock/low
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 14. Valuation as ADMIN → 200 ──────────────────────────────────────
GET {{api}}/stock/valuation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccess}}

### ─── 15. Valuation as STAFF → 403 FORBIDDEN ────────────────────────────
GET {{api}}/stock/valuation
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

### ─── 16. Stock-in as STAFF without the toggle → 403 FORBIDDEN ──────────
POST {{api}}/stock/in
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccess}}

{ "productId": "{{meterProductId}}", "qty": 10, "reason": "Should be refused" }
